{
	"name": "Aberrant Aspect",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/sundries/flags/banner-standard-moon.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p><strong>Passive Effect:</strong> You gain 60ft of Telepathy.</p><p><strong>Active Effect: </strong><em><strong>Psychic Thrust.</strong></em> As an action, you target one creature within 30ft and send a painful pulse through their mind. The target must make an Intelligence save against your Spell DC if you’re a spellcaster, Maneuver DC if you’re not. On a fail, the target takes 4d6 damage and is [[/condition id=rattled]] until the end of its next turn. A creature that is already Rattled becomes [[/condition id=stunned]] on a failure. On a success, the target takes half the damage and doesn’t suffer the relevant condition effect.</p>",
